   This machine runs the Denise demo panel on the console.

   The panel is back as soon as you log out of this session.
   To bring it back without logging out:   doas rc-service denise start
   To stop it and stay here:               doas rc-service denise stop

   Which demo runs at boot is `demo=` in /etc/conf.d/denise.
   The panel's own log is /var/log/denise.log; the splash writes to
   /run/denise-splash.log, which is cleared on every boot.

